        "original_id": "522c7732-cabe-5492-a6da-84900e084151",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Porsche 911, 997, 993, Carrera 4, Carrera 4S, Targa, 991\n- Companies: Porsche\n- Concepts: internal designations, glass canopy roof design\n\nFacts:\n- Porsche used 993 as the internal designation for a feature-heavy Porsche 911 version manufactured and sold between late 1993 and early 1998.\n- Porsche manufactured and sold the 997 Porsche 911 between 2004 as Model Year 2005 and 2012.\n- Targa versions of the Porsche 911 Carrera 4 and Carrera 4S were available in the 997 generation.\n- Targa Porsche 911 models from the 993 generation through the 991 generation used the glass canopy roof design.\n- The Porsche 991 replaced the 997 in 2012.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
